# Enquiry form endpoint (src/components/FaqContact.jsx, read in src/data/site.js).
#
# The form POSTs JSON to this URL: { name, email, phone, company, service, budget, message, agree }
# with headers Content-Type: application/json and Accept: application/json, and treats any 2xx response as "sent".
#
# To enable real submissions:
#   1. Create a form on a service that accepts JSON POSTs and emails you (e.g. Formspree, Web3Forms, Getform),
#      or point this at your own API route that sends the email.
#   2. Copy this file to .env and paste the endpoint URL below.
#   3. Restart `npm run dev` (or re-run `npm run build`) - Vite reads VITE_* variables at start/build time.
#   4. Submit one test enquiry and confirm it arrives in your inbox before going live.
#
# While this is empty, the form validates but tells visitors nothing was sent and shows the email/phone instead.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
